    title: "Attribute-level provenance on Symbol/Edge plus a pure arbitration property with one stamped default; schema patch bump (ADR-0057 rulings 1, 4)"  # 83a7
    status: todo_hard  # 83a7
    priority: 2  # 83a7
    parent:  # 83a7
